# ARCHITECTURE.md § 10 / STACK.md "Native build layout".
#
# xpsnr and vmaf are live from milestone 2; libjxl and jpegli from milestone 7.
#
# jpegli is its own repository. STACK.md said one libjxl submodule gave both it and
# SSIMULACRA 2; that stopped being true when upstream split jpegli out, and at libjxl's
# current head `lib/jpegli` does not exist. Corrected in STACK.md and PROJECT.md.
#
# oxipng is a cargo dependency of the wrapper crate in `oxipng/`, pinned in its Cargo.lock,
# rather than a submodule: upstream ships it as a library crate and there is no C to build.
#
# libheif stays commented out until something needs it — it is a fallback for devices where
# HeifWriter is unavailable, and an uncommented section with no gitlink makes
# `git submodule update --init` fail for everyone. Links verified against STACK.md.

[submodule "shared/native/xpsnr"]
	path = shared/native/xpsnr
	url = https://github.com/fraunhoferhhi/xpsnr.git
	shallow = true

[submodule "shared/native/vmaf"]
	path = shared/native/vmaf
	url = https://github.com/Netflix/vmaf.git
	shallow = true

#[submodule "shared/native/libheif"]
#	path = shared/native/libheif
#	url = https://github.com/strukturag/libheif.git
#	shallow = true

[submodule "shared/native/libjxl"]
	path = shared/native/libjxl
	url = https://github.com/libjxl/libjxl.git
	shallow = true
[submodule "shared/native/jpegli"]
	path = shared/native/jpegli
	url = https://github.com/google/jpegli.git
	shallow = true
